2.svg?dpl=3Ddpl_CEjisbLnWxFQGUTRjiHGoKY1oV5c"></div></figure>
<p>An important observation is that if a string is a palindrome, the first =
character would be the same as the last, the second character would be the =
same as the second-to-last, etc:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
